<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese escudo steady against the mark.</title>
<headline>Portuguese escudo steady against the mark.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese escudo was trading steady against the mark on Wednesday, in line with other crosses against the German currency.</p>
<p>The escudo stood at 100.30/32 per mark, compared with 100.32/37 at Tuesday's European close.</p>
<p>Dealers said they expected it to trade in a narrow range between 100.25 and 100.35 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
